results.description:
At Neo our goal is to expand your money management and transactional opportunities with our secure solutions and fully digital interface. Open a business or personal account with a unique European IBAN remotely, and enjoy simple and fast transfers, Mastercard payment cards, currency exchange at competitive tariffs, and more.

A wide range of benefits for personal and corporate needs:
 - Remote account opening;
 - Mobile app (iOS and Android) for access to funds 24/7;
 - International SWIFT & SEPA transfers;
 - Unique European IBANs;
 - Physical & virtual payment cards, powered by Mastercard;
 - Convenient currency exchange;
 - Mass payouts and other tools for corporate money management;
 - Security you can trust;
 - Expert customer support.

Our app was created to give you full control over daily financial operations and access to your funds 24/7, wherever you are:
 - Transfer initiation;
 - Card top-up;
 - Transaction history overview;
 - A chat with customer support representatives.

Managing international transfers and daily expenses, paying for digital subscriptions, sending and receiving salary, buying foreign currency, and withdrawing cash has never been easier. With a current account from Neo you will be able to do all that and much more, as we have an individual approach to our customers and always do our best to match your needs with the right product or service.
